) ____66. (Q.) Bhante ! While experiencing the deluding karma does a being attract bondage of deluding karma (mohaniya karma), or that of experience engendering karma (vedaniya karma) ?
(A.) Gautam ! While experiencing the deluding karma (mohaniya karma) a being attracts bondage of deluding karma (mohaniya karma) as well as that of experience engendering karma (vedaniya karma). But while experiencing the residual deluding karma or minute greed (charam mohaniya karma or sukshma lobh) a being attracts bondage of experience causing karma (vedaniya karma) only, and not that of deluding karma (mohaniya karma). (This happens at the tenth Gunasthan called Sukshmasamparaya where mohaniya karma is completely destroyed. Beyond that, from eleventh to thirteenth Gunasthan, Sayogi Kevali, there exists the bondage of vedaniya karma only and not that of mohaniya karma.) एकान्तबाल : एकान्तसुप्त का उपपात
